text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EA87 {
    "I’ll show you the sublime techniques\nI learned from our LEADER WALLACE!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EACF {
    "Please forgive me, WALLACE..."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EAED {
    "Watch what happens if you crack all\nthe floor tiles."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EB22 {
    "You came all the way here, but you won’t\nget to see WALLACE.\pNot if you lose to me, you won’t!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EB81 {
    "You’re strong!\nI was fooled by your cute looks!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EBB1 {
    "You might be good enough to avoid\nbeing wiped out in one hit by WALLACE."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EBFA {
    "The sight of WALLACE conducting a\nbattle...\pThe very beauty of it compelled me to\nbecome a TRAINER."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EC5E {
    "You battled with more beauty than\nI could muster..."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EC92 {
    "The grace you bring to battle is\nfabulous.\pOh... I’m so fortunate to have found\nPOKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818ECEB {
    "I should teach you how harsh battles\ncan be."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818ED18 {
    "Oh.\nYou’re strong."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818ED2B {
    "I’ll tell you something good.\pIf you want to reach WALLACE, you\nneed to walk on each floor tile once."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818ED91 {
    "The POKéMON GYM of the highest level\nin the HOENN region...\pThat’s the SOOTOPOLIS GYM."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EDE8 {
    "What a high level you are!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EE03 {
    "Rather than being satisfied by being\nin a strong GYM, I imagine training in\lother places will make you stronger.\lBut above all, it looks more fun."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EE96 {
    "I train my POKéMON together with\nWALLACE.\pDon’t think I’m a pushover."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EEDC {
    "I was bowled right over..."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EEF7 {
    "I think you have potential.\nWhy don’t you stay and train with us?"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EF39 {
    "A graceful glide across the ice while\ncrossing no lines...\pA TRAINER putting on that performance\nwould be elegantly beautiful!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EFB8 {
    "Well, excuse me?!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818EFCA {
    "This is really obvious, but how strong\nyou are as a TRAINER has nothing to do\lwith how young or old you are."
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818F037 {
    "When I’m with my POKéMON, the time\nflies by before you can say, “Oops!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818F07F {
    "Oops!"
}

text Naranja_IslaNueva_G15_M01_Text_0818F085 {
    "I wish I can forget about lost causes\nbefore I can manage an “Oops!”"
}
